<html lang="en-ZA">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="AA Creations & Events room setup and celebration decoration services.">
    <title>AA Creations & Events | Crafting Moments</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/Content/sstyle.css">
</head>
<body data-page="portfolio">

    <main>
      

        <section class="page-section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <p class="eyebrow">What We Celebrate</p>
                    <h2>Every Moment Deserves Magic</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="cards-grid three-columns">
                    <article class="occasion-card">
                        <div class="occasion-image">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558636508-e0db3814bd1d?w=500&h=350&fit=crop&auto=format" alt="Birthday celebration decoration">
                            <div class="occasion-overlay"></div>
                            <div class="occasion-title">
                                <span class="icon">🎂</span>
                                <strong>Birthdays</strong>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="occasion-copy">
                            <p>Make every birthday feel like a grand celebration with balloon arches, custom banners, and rose petal arrangements.</p>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="occasion-card">
                        <div class="occasion-image">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523438885200-e635ba2c371e?w=500&h=350&fit=crop&auto=format" alt="Romantic anniversary room decoration">
                            <div class="occasion-overlay"></div>
                            <div class="occasion-title">
                                <span class="icon">💍</span>
                                <strong>Anniversaries</strong>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="occasion-copy">
                            <p>Romantic setups with candles, heart balloons, and petals to honor the love story you've built together.</p>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="occasion-card">
                        <div class="occasion-image">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1627556704302-624286467c65?w=500&h=350&fit=crop&auto=format" alt="Graduation celebration">
                            <div class="occasion-overlay"></div>
                            <div class="occasion-title">
                                <span class="icon">🎓</span>
                                <strong>Graduations</strong>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="occasion-copy">
                            <p>Celebrate academic milestones with statement letter balloons, congrats banners, and confetti-filled décor.</p>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="packages" class="page-section packages-section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <p class="eyebrow">Official Pricing</p>
                    <h2>Our Decoration Packages</h2>
                    <p>All packages are for room setup. Transport fee is charged separately.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="cards-grid three-columns">
                    <article class="package-card">
                        <div class="package-photo">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1527529482837-4698179dc6ce?w=600&h=400&fit=crop&auto=format" alt="Balloon ceiling decoration setup">
                            <span class="package-badge" style="background:#7a3a5c;">Starter</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="package-body">
                            <h3>Basic Package</h3>
                            <p class="package-tagline">Perfect for intimate celebrations</p>
                            <div class="package-price">
                                <strong>R650</strong><span>per setup</span>
                            </div>
                            <ul class="package-list">
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>Happy Birthday / Anniversary Banner</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>40 Ceiling Balloons</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>10 Floor Balloons</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>Artificial Rose Petals on Bed</span></li>
                            </ul>
                            <a class="btn btn-outline package-button" href="@Url.Action("Booking", "Cust")?package=basic">Book This Package</a>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="package-card featured">
                        <div class="package-photo">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1530103862676-de8c9debad1d?w=600&h=400&fit=crop&auto=format" alt="Standard balloon and rose petal room decoration">
                            <span class="package-badge" style="background:#c51562;">Popular</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="package-body">
                            <h3>Standard Package</h3>
                            <p class="package-tagline">Our most popular celebration setup</p>
                            <div class="package-price">
                                <strong>R850</strong><span>per setup</span>
                            </div>
                            <ul class="package-list">
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>Happy Birthday / Anniversary / I Love You Banner</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>50 Ceiling Balloons</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>20 Floor Balloons</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>8 Bed Balloons</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>4 Heart Balloons</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>Age Balloons</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>Artificial Rose Petals on Bed</span></li>
                            </ul>
                            <a class="btn btn-primary package-button" href="@Url.Action("Booking", "Cust")?package=standard">Book This Package</a>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="package-card">
                        <div class="package-photo">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464366400600-7168b8af9bc3?w=600&h=400&fit=crop&auto=format" alt="Premium luxury room decoration with candles and balloons">
                            <span class="package-badge" style="background:#0d0008;">Premium</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="package-body">
                            <h3>Premium Package</h3>
                            <p class="package-tagline">The full luxury experience</p>
                            <div class="package-price">
                                <strong>R1,000</strong><span>per setup</span>
                            </div>
                            <ul class="package-list">
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>Happy Birthday / Anniversary / I Love You Banner</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>Bed-Fitting Ceiling Balloons</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>30 Floor Balloons</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>10 Bed Balloons</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>6 Heart Balloons</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>Age Balloons</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>Artificial Rose Petals on Bed & Floor</span></li>
                                <li><span class="check">✓</span><span>Artificial Candles</span></li>
                            </ul>
                            <a class="btn btn-outline package-button" href="@Url.Action("Booking", "Cust")?package=premium">Book This Package</a>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="page-section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <p class="eyebrow">Extras</p>
                    <h2>Add-On Services</h2>
                    <p>Enhance any package with these optional extras during booking.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="addon-grid">
                    <div class="addon-card"><span class="addon-icon">🎈</span><div><p class="addon-name">Extra Balloon Bouquet</p><p class="addon-price">+R50</p></div></div>
                    <div class="addon-card"><span class="addon-icon">🎊</span><div><p class="addon-name">Confetti Cannon</p><p class="addon-price">+R80</p></div></div>
                    <div class="addon-card"><span class="addon-icon">✨</span><div><p class="addon-name">LED Fairy Lights</p><p class="addon-price">+R120</p></div></div>
                    <div class="addon-card"><span class="addon-icon">🌸</span><div><p class="addon-name">Flower Wall Backdrop</p><p class="addon-price">+R200</p></div></div>
                    <div class="addon-card"><span class="addon-icon">🔡</span><div><p class="addon-name">Custom Letter/Number Balloons</p><p class="addon-price">+R150</p></div></div>
                    <div class="addon-card"><span class="addon-icon">🕯️</span><div><p class="addon-name">Scented Candle Set</p><p class="addon-price">+R90</p></div></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="page-section testimonials">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:#e91e8c;">What Our Clients Say</p>
                    <h2 style="color:#fff;">Moments They'll Never Forget</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="cards-grid three-columns">
                    <article class="review-card">
                        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
                        <p class="review-text">"Thank you AA Creations for turning my small celebration into an unforgettable experience."</p>
                        <p class="review-name">— Sindy Mabaso</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="review-card">
                        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
                        <p class="review-text">"The room looked absolutely stunning. Every detail was perfect and my partner was in tears!"</p>
                        <p class="review-name">— Lerato Dlamini</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="review-card">
                        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
                        <p class="review-text">"Booked the Premium package for my anniversary. The candles and petals made it so romantic."</p>
                        <p class="review-name">— Thandi Nkosi</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="page-section cta-section">
            <div class="container">
                <h2>Ready to Create the Moment?</h2>
                <p>Book your setup online in minutes. You bring the guest of honour, we bring the wow.</p>
                <a class="btn btn-gradient" href="@Url.Action("Booking", "Cust")">Book Your Celebration Setup</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <script src="~/Scripts/Common.js"></script>

    <script>
  document.getElementById("viewPackagesButton")?.addEventListener("click", () => {
    document.getElementById("packages")?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: "smooth" });
  });
    </script>
</body>
</html>